 "**C.** → True\n\n1) The claim says that if Bianca competes, then Zane does not.\n\n2) Fact used: the Rule block — rule (6) is Zane $\\Rightarrow \\neg$ Bianca, and the quoted sentence is its contrapositive.\n\n3) Comparison: contrapositive and rule always agree, so the two never compete together; in the four rosters of Step 6, Bianca appears only alongside Yara.\n\n**Conclusion:** the statement is true.",
